Of the fire, and of the Parjanya, and of the Pashupati. 1. Meaning of the word

Brahma-astra-saya—of Brahma-astra; cha—therefore; Brahma-astram—from Brahma-astra; vayavyasya—of air weapon; cha—therefore; Parvatam—mountain;
Astra-se—of fire weapon; aagneyasya—of fire weapon; cha—therefore; Parjanyam—from rain weapon; naigam—from one's own personal (Narayanastra);
Pashupatasya—of Shiva's Pashupatastra; cha—therefore;
Pashupatasya—of Pashupatastra; cha—therefore;
